        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4620, 14-5/8 Inch Augustine Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA true work of art, this ornate refrigerator pull has intricate detailing that grant it a stately appearance. The Augustine Pull is perfect for refrigerators as well as all your kitchen's big appliances. The Ornate Augustine Refrigerator Handle is available in 7 finishes including polished nickel, Valencia bronze, and distressed nickel (pictured). RK International's 14-5/8 Inch Augustine Appliance Pull has a 10-3/4 inch center to center. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/augustine-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-620\"><b>Augustine Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n and <a href=\"/products/augustine-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-120\"><b>Augustine Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 10\" Center to Center Ornate Appliance Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws for a refrigerator/appliance door panel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR50_size.gif?v=1704354712\" width=\"586\" height=\"116\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
